    "description": "Hand-simplified bounding polygons for major US National Marine Sanctuaries. Used by Fishing with Friends for display-time MPA suppression on the catch map. Polygons are intentionally coarse — they over-approximate the protected area, which is privacy-correct (a catch displayed slightly offset because it sits near a sanctuary boundary is harmless; the goal is to never reveal a catch inside one).",
